<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait T-bill balance grows 12.7 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Kuwait T-bill balance grows 12.7 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The outstanding balance of treasury bills issued by Kuwait's Central Bank grew 12.7 percent to 1.589 billion dinars at the end of June from 1.409 billion at the end of May, a Central Bank bulletin said.</p>
<p>The outstanding balance of public debt instruments -- bonds and bills -- rose 0.07 percent to 2.693 billion dinars at the end of June from 2.690 billion dinars at the end of May.</p>
<p>The balance of public debt instruments was 2.872 billion in June 1995.</p>
<p>			Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				June '96		June '95</p>
<p>Bills</p>
<p>  Matured		     310.8		   395.2</p>
<p>  New Issue		   490.0		   403.1</p>
<p>  Balance		    1588.5		  2097.3</p>
<p>Bonds</p>
<p>  Matured		     276.9		   166.0</p>
<p>  New Issue		   100.0		   276.9</p>
<p>  Balance		    1104.0		   775.0</p>
<p>Slight discrepancies in figures are due to rounding.</p>
<p>-- Inal Ersan, Kuwait newsroom +965-243-1920</p>
